<title>POLAND: Polish construction sales fall 16.5 pct m/m in Nov.</title>
<headline>Polish construction sales fall 16.5 pct m/m in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales fell 16.5 percent in November but were 13.7 percent higher than in November 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p> POLISH CONSTRUCTION	  NOVEMBER    OCTOBER    NOVEMBER 95</p>
<p> month/month pct change	  -16.5	  13.2	     0.0</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   13.7	  18.3	     9.7</p>
<p> index (monthly avge 1994=100)  42.7	   NA		 NA</p>
<p>					    JAN-NOV 96	JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p> pct change vs same period		 6.2	     15.5</p>
<p>NOTES - Revised data in brackets. November 1996 and 1995 had 21 working days, while October 1996 had had 24 days.</p>
</text>
